[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0327","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0158","title":"Cisco PIX Firewall Manager 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX 防火墙管理器（PFM）运行于 Windows NT 系统时，其 8080 端口存在未授权访问漏洞。远程攻击者可在已知目标文件名及路径的条件下，通过向 8080 端口发送 HTTP 请求获取任意文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响早期 Cisco PIX 防火墙管理软件，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0158"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:43Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX Firewall Manager 至 4.2(2) 或更高版本，或安装 Cisco 提供的安全补丁（参见 Cisco 安全公告）。作为临时缓解措施，在防火墙和主机层面限制对 PFM 服务器 TCP 8080 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。鉴于 Cisco PIX 及 Windows NT 均已停止维护，建议尽快迁移至受支持的安全平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/pixmgrfile-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/685"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0164","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0065","title":"Sun Solaris CDE dtmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Solaris CDE 桌面环境中的 dtmail 邮件客户端在处理邮件附件时存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标用户发送带有特制附件的邮件，当受害者使用 dtmail 打开或预览邮件时，附件处理过程中的边界检查不足导致缓冲区溢出，攻击者可利用该漏洞在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行 CDE 桌面环境的多个 Solaris 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0065"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:29Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun（现 Oracle）提供的对应 Solaris 版本补丁（如 Sun 公告 00172 / 00173），将 CDE dtmail 升级到修补后的版本。如无法打补丁，建议禁用 dtmail 或限制其仅监听本地回环地址，并移除 setuid 权限以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/181"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1299","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1041","title":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 本地堆栈溢出漏洞","description":"tags as required.<value>SCO OpenServer 5.0 和 SCO UNIX 3.2v4 系统中的 mscreen 程序存在本地堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过设置超长的 TERM 环境变量或在 .mscreenrc 配置文件中写入超长条目来触发该溢出，从而在本地获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。由于需要本地访问权限才能利用，攻击者需先获得系统的普通用户账户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1041"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:34Z","remediation":"建议升级至 SCO OpenServer 5.0.7 或更高版本（含官方补丁 SCO-1999.001），或迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。临时缓解：移除 /usr/bin/mscreen 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/mscreen），限制 TERM 环境变量长度（export TERM=vt100），限制用户写入 ~/.mscreenrc 权限（chmod 644 ~/.mscreenrc）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90686250717719&w=2","http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-98.10.sco.mscreen","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10420","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f3f1d799c1c9e44bc999093e18341513cabfa3f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1041.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1041","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1041.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fb79aaf8eeeb3ec551114292cd7a8693e166aee6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1041.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xm8j-jw8c-j4ww/GHSA-xm8j-jw8c-j4ww.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-1041.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--11db4952-bc8b-4b8e-a026-44679b45b8a8.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1299.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1503","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1416","title":"Inso dwhttpd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Inso dwhttpd 3.1a4（AnswerBook2 Web服务器）存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 Content-Length 头的 HTTP POST 请求，耗尽服务器资源导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 dwhttpd 3.1a4 版本，在未打补丁的情况下，攻击者无需认证即可实施攻击，影响服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1416"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:23Z","remediation":"该产品 Inso dwhttpd 3.1a4（AnswerBook2 Web 服务器）已停止维护，官方未发布任何安全补丁。建议立即停止使用该服务，迁移至受支持的现代 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。如暂时无法迁移，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制 HTTP POST 请求的 Content-Length 最大值（如限制为 10MB），并仅允许可信 IP 访问该服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10383","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/253","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1416.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1416","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1416.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1416.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f286-vvp8-p9v8/GHSA-f286-vvp8-p9v8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1416.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000355.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b091b773-7fd0-40a4-b740-cc6ed813f510.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/62a8c583731615d6914ea6a751d3034ea83cc12f/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1503.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1503.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1504","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1417","title":"Sun AnswerBook2 dwhttpd 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"AnswerBook2 (AB2) Web 服务器 dwhttpd 3.1a4 存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统发送包含编码 % 字符的恶意 HTTP 请求，触发服务器日志记录功能的格式化字符串处理缺陷，进而导致拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Sun AnswerBook2 3.1a4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1417"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1998-08-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 AnswerBook2（dwhttpd）至 3.1 以上已修复版本，或安装 Sun 提供的对应 Solaris 安全补丁。若产品已停止维护，应立即停止 AnswerBook2 服务并禁用相关端口（默认 TCP 8888），在防火墙上限制对该端口的访问。建议迁移至现代文档服务器方案替代 AnswerBook2。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10383","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/253","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1417","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1417.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-89rj-v9gf-rwhm/GHSA-89rj-v9gf-rwhm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0326","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0326.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0157","title":"Cisco IOS IP Fragmentation 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 的 IP 分片重组处理逻辑存在缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标路由器发送特制的 IP 分片数据包，触发设备在处理分片重组时进入死循环或异常状态，导致路由器崩溃、重启或停止响应正常流量。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 11.2p、11.3t、12.0、12.0t 等版本，无需身份认证即可远程触发，危害等级高危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0157"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"1998-08-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.1 及以上版本，或升级 PIX Firewall 软件至 5.0 及以上版本；在接口配置 `ip virtual-reassembly` 命令启用虚拟分片重组功能以抵御分片攻击；配置 CBAC 时启用分片检查（`ip inspect name` 配合分片超时参数）；无法升级时可在边界 ACL 中拒绝异常分片包（如非初始分片且偏移量过小的包）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0326.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1451","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1283","title":"Opera Web Browser 畸形URL拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 3.2.1 浏览器存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向用户发送包含畸形 http:// 标签（在协议标记中插入额外斜杠 /）的特制 URL 触发该漏洞，导致浏览器应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Opera 3.2.1 版本，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需身份认证，但需诱使用户点击恶意链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1283"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-08-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Opera 3.5 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。由于 Opera 3.2.1 已停止维护，建议用户升级到最新受支持版本或更换使用现代浏览器如 Firefox、Chrome 等以避免该安全问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10320","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1541","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1283"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1451.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0328","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0159","title":"Cisco IOS ICMP 不可达消息拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 存在拒绝服务漏洞。具有交互式命令行访问权限（如登录提示符）的攻击者，可通过向受影响设备发送特制命令序列，触发设备内核崩溃或重启，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 9.x、10.x 及 11.x 系列版本，攻击前提是已获取设备的交互式访问权限（如 Telnet/SSH 登录后的 CLI 环境），属于需要一定认证条件的本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0159"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"1998-08-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。若无法升级，应在路由器上限制交互式访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址通过 SSH 或带外管理接口登录，并配置 ACL 过滤可疑 TCP RST 报文作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1389","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1199","title":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.1 MIME 头部拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.1 及更早版本存在 MIME 头部解析拒绝服务漏洞（又名 Sioux 漏洞）。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量同名 MIME 头的恶意 HTTP 请求，导致服务器资源耗尽而无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响所有运行 Apache 1.3.1 及之前版本的系统，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS v2.0 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至 Apache 1.3.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1199"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-08-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.2 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 1.3.2 中修复）。若无法升级，可在 httpd.conf 中通过 LimitRequestFields 指令限制单个请求允许的 HTTP 头字段数量，防止资源耗尽。建议直接升级至 2.4.x 最新稳定版以获得全面安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90252779826784&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90276683825862&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90280517007869&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90286768232093&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh51-errata-general.html#apache"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1389.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0446","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0262","title":"Hylafax 4.0 pl2 Faxsurvey CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Hylafax 4.0 pl2 的 faxsurvey CGI 脚本未对用户输入进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过在查询字符串中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Linux 平台上的 Hylafax 4.0 pl2 版本，攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，可能导致服务器完全受控。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0262"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-08-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:01Z","remediation":"升级到 Hylafax 4.1 或更高版本，移除或禁用 faxsurvey CGI 脚本，限制 CGI 目录的执行权限，在 Web 服务器层面过滤传入 query string 中的 shell 元字符（如 `;`、`|`、`$`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2056","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1532","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20462","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0cda26301f5b3e56ace35e3d98835812d878db41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0262","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0262.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/638fc08494602a9faf37bf81043122f16d26625c/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0262.json","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/6723edd43ced2a9627d0c0e8bf12d208cfde84d5/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0262.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0161","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0062","title":"OpenBSD chpass 文件描述符泄漏本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 系统中的 chpass 命令存在文件描述符泄露漏洞，本地普通用户可利用该漏洞获取 root 权限。由于 chpass 在处理用户密码更改操作时未正确管理文件描述符，攻击者可通过精心构造的调用方式使进程泄露高权限文件句柄，从而实现对系统的完全控制。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.x 及更早版本，需本地账户访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0062"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-08-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:29Z","remediation":"立即应用 OpenBSD 2.3 errata 004 号补丁，该补丁修复了 chpass(1) 的文件描述符泄漏问题，阻止攻击者篡改 /etc/master.passwd。如运行更低版本（2.2 及之前），应升级至至少 2.3 版本并应用全部安全补丁。临时缓解措施：严格限制本地用户登录权限，仅授予可信用户 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7559"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0770","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0770.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0516","title":"简单网络管理协议 SNMP 社区名可猜测漏洞","description":"SNMP协议使用community name作为访问认证凭据，该漏洞源于目标设备的SNMP社区名可被推测（如使用默认值或弱密码），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过暴力破解或字典攻击的方式猜测出有效的community name。攻击成功后，攻击者可获取网络设备或主机的系统信息、接口状态、路由表等敏感SNMP管理数据，进而为进一步渗透提供情报支持。该漏洞影响所有运行SNMP服务的网络设备、服务器及打印机等终端，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。建议管理员将community name修改为高强度字符串并限制SNMP服务的访问来源。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0516"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:33Z","remediation":"将 SNMP 设备默认的 public/private 等团体名修改为高强度随机字符串，并升级设备固件/系统至厂商修复版本（如 Cisco IOS 更新、Windows SNMP 服务补丁）。在网络层通过 ACL 或防火墙仅允许受信任的管理主机访问 UDP 161/162 端口，并优先改用 SNMPv3 启用认证与加密以彻底消除明文团体名泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0516","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-243","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-243/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10323cb4135457b41074412d623aa2116c4e1200/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0516.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0516","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0516.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efc2590fd3e232024591793a186ed6577aaac2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0516.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/cd275183e69131386d0c86c5a1716b6a67ff7687/references/CVE-1999-0516-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdec8f567bb266b7b6813bda45223a258023f538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p65v-7qg9-x6wf/GHSA-p65v-7qg9-x6wf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/snmp_default_communities.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/7791e876271b236b6833e2bc934b5a39586a3067/references/contrib1-CVE-1999-0516-2025-03-17-1422","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0770.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0558","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0339","title":"Sun Solaris libauth 库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统 libauth 认证库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该库函数传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得额外的系统权限，可能提升至 root 级别。该漏洞影响多个 Solaris 版本，攻击者需拥有本地账号才能发起利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0339"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:11Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该漏洞的 Solaris 版本（如 Solaris 7 及以上），安装 Sun 官方补丁 105401-xx（针对 libauth 库缓冲区溢出）。若无法升级，限制本地用户登录并启用最小权限原则，仅授权可信用户访问系统，同时监控异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0339"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0479","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0288","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 WINS 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的 WINS 服务器在处理 UDP 137 端口（NetBIOS 名称服务）的数据包时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量特制的无效 UDP 帧，导致 WINS 服务进程异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 SP4 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，利用方式简单，发送随机数据包洪流即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0288"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:04Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 (SP4) 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 WINS 服务对畸形 UDP 数据包的处理逻辑。如无法升级，在防火墙或主机层面阻止外部对 UDP 端口 137 (NETBIOS 名称服务) 的访问，仅允许可信内部网络通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://safenetworks.com/Windows/wins.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1233","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19238","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e927b0fe51353a8ed03f0466aad3c47ffd172da3/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0288.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0288","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0288.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c57fab4f71bd6fdcec1202e5361e2a9805c4950/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0288.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j989-83h4-x7f9/GHSA-j989-83h4-x7f9.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/wins_udp_flood.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0288.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0455","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0455.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0269","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server 3.x/4.x PageServices 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netscape Enterprise Server 3.x 及 4.x 版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 PageServices 查询请求，无需任何身份认证即可枚举服务器上的文件列表，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取 Web 目录结构、配置文件路径等关键信息，为进一步攻击提供铺垫。该漏洞影响范围较广，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0269"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:02Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Netscape Enterprise Server 4.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 PageServices 目录列表漏洞。如无法升级，在服务器配置中禁用 PageServices 功能或删除相关 CGI 脚本。鉴于 Netscape Enterprise Server 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0269","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22611","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0269.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0269.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0269","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58eef6eedd760f280b47bfb4c94db9995b29c5a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0269.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0269.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qqpc-2hm2-rq5r/GHSA-qqpc-2hm2-rq5r.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/netscape_PageServices.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0269.json","https://github.com/idabeygunarathna/network-scanning-kali/blob/a0d5890e2fe9f211390468c6077814becf5610d6/nikto_report.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0455.toml"}]